On Tuesday, February 2, 2016, at 4:00 p.m. the Committee will convene at 4:00 p.m. in 1324 Longworth House Office Building for opening statements only.  The Committee will reconvene on Wednesday, February 3, 2016 at 10:00 a.m. until 12:00 p.m. in in the 1324 Longworth House Office Building.

